ion of the free trial will be forfeited if you purchase a subscription.<br><br>FEEDBACK &amp; SUPPORT<br>\u2295 If you like PepTalk, don\u2019t hesitate to rate us on the App Store!<br>\u2295 If you have any questions, feedback, suggestions, or simply want to say \u201cHi!\u201d, feel free to contact us at hi@peptalkapp.com<br><br>LEGAL<br>Terms of Use: https://peptalkapp.com/terms<br>Privacy Policy: https://peptalkapp.com/privacypolicy",
